  "notes": "Undervisningspligt starts with the school year in the calendar year a child turns 6 and lasts ten years. The folkeskole is one ten-year school: yngstetrin 1.–3., mellemtrin 4.–7., ældstetrin 8.–10. klasse. Unlike Denmark, the first year is 1. klasse (no børnehaveklasse) and 10. klasse is part of the compulsory course. GUX admits pupils on their 10. klasse marks and final exams and lasts three years (four on the sports line), 1.g–3.g. Greenlandic names for the single years are not confirmed, so only Danish ones are given."
